                        "entry_id": "e24205a4-9c09-3393-a025-0234c848166c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An aging buffoon."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e166076a-db39-418c-924a-06616ad20ae9",
                                "sense_id": "0b9081e5-ed67-39d5-912e-2ddafadb624e",
                                "text": "Hic ibat, as I told you before, —Simois, I am\nLucentio, hic est, son unto Vincentio of Pisa,—\nSigeia tellus, disguised thus to get your love; —\nHic steterat, and that Lucentio that comes\na-wooing, — Priami, is my man Tranio, —\nregia, bearing my port, celsa senis, that we\nmight beguile the old pantaloon."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "15b84ca8-bd6d-4cf0-a3f5-475e9162a10e",
                                "sense_id": "0b9081e5-ed67-39d5-912e-2ddafadb624e",
                                "text": "They constantly followed the virtuous pair, who as constantly eluded their grasp, whilst they themselves met with every kind of misfortune, until they became clown and pantaloon, […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "de6768f3-6856-4810-8e88-e0658231ab76",
                                "sense_id": "0b9081e5-ed67-39d5-912e-2ddafadb624e",
                                "text": "The Bishop is a lean and slippered pantaloon, at least in his old clerical garments which he thinks good enough for the sea."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3756b502-5165-3709-bd18-67d44451a4c7",
                        "entry_id": "e24205a4-9c09-3393-a025-0234c848166c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Trousers reminiscent of the tight-fitting leggings traditionally worn by a pantaloon."
